1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,846
Meet VeroniQA, your AI assistant for API testing.

2
00:00:04,966 --> 00:00:09,286
She turns your requirements into tests that run, and results you can trust.

3
00:00:09,986 --> 00:00:16,135
Add what your team already has: requirement documents, PDF files, or links to your docs.

4
00:00:16,835 --> 00:00:18,863
Ask a question in plain English.

5
00:00:18,983 --> 00:00:23,136
She answers from your own documents, and shows the passages she used.

6
00:00:23,836 --> 00:00:25,800
Then just say: run the tests.

7
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:30,199
She writes and runs API tests, then triages every failure.

8
00:00:30,319 --> 00:00:34,863
In this demo, she found both planted bugs, with 46 tests passing.

9
00:00:35,563 --> 00:00:43,517
On our simulated benchmark, AgentQA found 94% of the planted bugs, at 47% of the cost.

10
00:00:44,217 --> 00:00:47,576
VeroniQA. Ask, add knowledge, and run the tests.
